2331
02:21:07.868 --> 02:21:09.369
No. no. no. no. Give it to him.

2332
02:21:10.245 --> 02:21:11.747
No. no. no. Give it to him.

2333
02:21:14.458 --> 02:21:16.793
Oh. my God. Thank you. Thank you.

2334
02:21:21.548 --> 02:21:24.968
[cheering]

2335
